EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}What do you think of my room?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Pretty cool, right? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Anything
you're interested in?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Yes!
No.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Te gusta mi casa?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿A que es la más chupiguay
que has visto?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¿Hay algún mueble que te guste?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
¡Sí!
No

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Beh, che ne pensi di casa mia?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}È il meglio del meglio, eh?
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}C'è qualcosa che ti interessa?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Sì!
No.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Odamı nasıl buldun?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bayağı havalı, değil mi? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}İlgini çeken
bir şey var mı?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Evet!
Hayır.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}What do you think of my furniture? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I bet there's something in here you
REALLY love, right?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Yes!
No.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Mobilyalarımı nasıl buldun? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Bahse girerim burada ÇOK sevdiğin
bir şey vardır, değil mi?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Evet!
Hayır.

{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Bu odayı tasarlarken aşırı seçiciydim.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Bahse girerim bayıldığın bir şey
vardır, değil mi?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Evet, var!
Hayır, hiçbir şey.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}¡Se nota que tienes buen gusto!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¿Y si te digo que puedes llevarte
algo a casa?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ¿A que sería lo más?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Show me something you like!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I won't let go of everything in here,
but you never know, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Fammi vedere cosa ti piace!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Non tutto è in vendita, ma
non si sa mai, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Zeig mir etwas, das dir gefällt!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ich werd zwar nicht alles hergeben,
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}aber wer weiß, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Beğendiğin bir şeyi göster!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Buradaki her şeyden vazgeçmem ama belli mi
olur, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Show me something you like!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I may not let it go, but feel free
to ask, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Enséñame cuál te gusta!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Quién sabe... ¡Quizá me sienta
generosa!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sag mir, was dir hier drin gefällt!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Vielleicht kannst du es ja haben!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Mal gucken, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Show me something you like!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
It's worth asking, though I might
say no. But whatever!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Muéstrame lo que te gusta!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡No prometo dártelo, pero
inténtalo igualmente!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Fammi vedere cosa ti piace!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Magari ti dirò di no, ma chiedere
non costa nulla!
